{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116735","id":3322436777,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7GCFyp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116735","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116735.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116735.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116735","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116735/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116735/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116735/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4187c46f53346ca8adcf49dc7495c1e75769881e","number":116735,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add Start Offset to AudioStreamSynchronized","user":{"login":"BuzzLord","id":11238951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjM4OTUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11238951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord","html_url":"https://github.com/BuzzLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BuzzLord/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"An attempt at adding audio stream scheduling to Godot. This change adds a new `offset` parameter to the `AudioStreamSynchronized` streams, that is a time in seconds. When the `AudioStreamSynchronized` is playing, it keeps track of its own playback time, and will wait to start mixing in the streams until their offset time has come. It calculates it down to the frame (or as close as it can get based on the audio servers mix rate). Since all the times are relative to the overall `AudioStreamSynchronized` playback, this should make it easy schedule sounds to play at any exact time you want, relative to each other.\r\n\r\nSeeking also works, and will restart any streams that have completed, if needed.\r\n\r\nThere is currently an arbitrary limit (32) on the number of streams that can be added, but maybe that can be changed if we think it necessary for this to be useful. Also, adding streams dynamically does not work smoothly, as it stops the playback as part of its re-initialization. This means you can't bypass the 32 limit by dynamically adding/removing streams on the fly.\r\n\r\nPotentially fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1151.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id"